B.am2=new A.my("barAndRefreshments",6,"Bar & Refreshments","Beer tokens, food at the on-on, prepaid bar tabs.\n\nUnit cost is what the bar charges the kennel. Price charged is what the hasher pays, which for a subsidised bar may well be less.",B.ahE,4,"barAndRefreshments")
